Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:17.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Y'know, it's embarrassing even for me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:35.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I really wanna take in what \Nyou're going to say, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:46.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:29.00,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,519)\pos(493.222,300.778)}Episode 8              Adults
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:37.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, there you have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin's gonna be coming by every \Nnow and then to hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I figured... you should know, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.97,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for having me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:52.34,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to have you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.73,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,You let me know if anything's \Nbothering you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.73,0:02:56.89,main,Rin,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:03.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No, I mean, nothing bothers me \Nabout Senpai! Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:08.42,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Was that a good answer?! \NDid I do that right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.96,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,My boy is finally leaving the nest...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:19.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-If you're worried about that, \NI can always move into this nest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:27.82,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Y'know, I always did want a daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why are you so on board with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:31.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it that way, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can play the role \Nof daughter or sister, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Because I get a lot of practice \Nportraying Senpai's harem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:44.76,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Eiji...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Were you cleaning up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Getting rid of old books and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:03.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Mom's gonna chew me out \Nif I don't get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But she seems so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,These... aren't really the kind of \Nnotepads you're supposed to doodle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:21.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sensei, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:28.18,main,Demure Rin,0,0,0,,If you hadn't been able to graduate, \NI could've helped you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:31.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Dammit, I just had to barely \Nmake it over the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That is a good thing, right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:41.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This is from our trip to Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's not that funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:57.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,These are all getting put away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:05:00.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That seems like such a shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:04.93,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you getting rid of your uniform too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:06.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah. No need to wear it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I won't get to see you \Nin that uniform ever again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't say it with that look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:16.87,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But, y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:20.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We could go on dates wearing our uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:25.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on, what's the harm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.72,main,Eiji Mom,0,0,0,,Would I be interrupting right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:37.63,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What else am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:42.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please, it can't end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.07,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,That sounds bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:50.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of random \Ntoys in here, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:53.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah, I use it to make props.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:58.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Clay! That takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:05:59.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Feel free to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin-san... what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:10.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is it a landslide?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:21.36,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd get it, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:24.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can spoil you that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:27.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But calling it a landslide?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:28.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,My bad, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:34.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Crash!{or some other onamatapeia that reflects a landslide}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You can have him, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:49.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh... but what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:54.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:58.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Make sure to put it on display!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But what exactly is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:11.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um, Senpai, are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.10,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe a little too childish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:18.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe less "us" and more "you," Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:27.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want to do something more grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What, like holding each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You seem pretty childish to me, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:59.94,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then it's a race to see \Nwho can grow up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:11.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Go on. Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:28.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sorry about the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.30,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You actually wore the uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:39.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's a little embarrassing, though, \Nsince I'm too grown up for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:40.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But it suits you perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wearing this uniform really reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:52.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Of those days I spent, \Ngiving it my all, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That was just the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:02.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's all coming back so vividly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It wasn't that long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:14.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I like the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You've got a needlessly \Npleasant texture, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're acting like \Na high school student, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I guess I got carried away...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:34.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I'm not some kid who gets giddy \Nat the sight of a stuffed critter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:39.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"Play with me some more!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:43.93,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"I'm real fluffy! Feels real good!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:49.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:56.19,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This texture... might be my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:09:59.95,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Want me to buy you one \Nas an enrollment present?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:01.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I want a hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.69,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Now that is childish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:10.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's a relief seeing you're \Nstill acting like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:15.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Dang it! I really wanna show \Noff my adult side, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:20.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What about paying the adult ticket price?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.56,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Oh, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:32.75,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya! Are you on the way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:35.36,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was at Moe-chan's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Good to see you again, Ayaka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.61,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:49.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're gonna catch a cold \Nif you don't dress more warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.07,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,So fluffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:57.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.26,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,They're warm and comfy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:04.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now, make a fist like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:08.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And then we bump elbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:09.76,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You never change, do you, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:21.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I mean, you treat everyone the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You do...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:26.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:30.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I think the way you're able to act \Ndifferently depending on if you're acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:33.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,or being a kouhai, \Nor a big sister is more impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:40.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I hope you keep being \Nable to adapt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:45.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Into Tsundere-chan \Nand Imp-chan and the rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:48.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You laughed at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.24,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,Onee-chan, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, we can give them back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Aya, can I borrow those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:10.81,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:17.96,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(159.334,285.667)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:22.97,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(522.89,344.334)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:28.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What kind of adult do you wanna be \Nwhen you grow up, Megu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.97,main,Megu,0,0,0,,A sexy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Must be nice having such a clear goal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:41.45,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You must be really out of it. \NI gave you a huge opening just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:46.23,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You must be desperate \Nto catch up to Senpai-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:54.80,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Well, I think people who have \Nit together are pretty mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, if you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.89,main,Rin,0,0,0,,our job is to enjoy this \Nlast year as high-schoolers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:04.46,main,Rin,0,0,0,,instead of trying so hard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:05.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:07.19,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Wow, what got into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:16.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Fine, I guess I don't \Nhave it together at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:21.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder if Senpai's \Ngonna be okay in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:23.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I hope he's making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:26.31,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Now you're sounding grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:27.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:34.41,main,Megu,0,0,0,,By worrying more about \Nsomeone other than yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:40.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder if that boy will be \Nable to handle his own meals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:42.15,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, that's just being his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:51.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wonder how college students dress...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:55.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I... have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.79,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You gotta help me make some choices, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:02.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If I choose, I'm just gonna end up \Nwith more wacky t-shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You really want my help?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.57,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't wait for Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:12.58,sign_20346_165_Calling_Kitahama,Phone sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HB0B0B0&\frx8\fry12\pos(358.555,110.889)\frz18.99}Calling Kitahama-Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:12.58,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wonder who I should \Nhave pick them out for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:14.97,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:19.76,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet Demure-chan would \Npick out some mature clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:23.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I am not going to be acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:26.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet Spoiled-chan is pretty fashionable...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:29.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.52,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Me! I'm going to choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:34.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I showed up pretty early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:46.10,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Was I looking forward to this too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:47.77,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,We weren't supposed to meet until 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.40,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'll contact her later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.24,sign_20346_165_Calling_Kitahama,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\c&H656565&\fs12\frz13.26\pos(402.112,31.779)}Okay, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.24,sign_20346_165_Calling_Kitahama,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\c&H656565&\fs12\frz12.88\pos(305.223,110.001)}Right. Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.24,sign_20346_165_Calling_Kitahama,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\frz7.995\pos(340.777,167.778)}{\c&H656565&\fs12\frz13.26\pos(402.112,31.779)}-Today-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.24,sign_21435_181_Could_we_meet_up,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\frz12.91\pos(374,237.333)}Could we meet up a little early today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:01.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Nah. I just woke up." There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Nah. I just woke up." There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:11.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, you liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:20.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Were you looking forward to seeing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:24.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, you showed up early, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, I was really excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:29.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No fair, being honest at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:33.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you feel the same way, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:39.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Besides, aren't the shops \Nstill closed this early?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.17,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:54.15,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No, the colors are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:56.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Something more mellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:59.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And maybe a longer hem...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She keeps muttering to herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:03.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I tried it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You look so grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:15.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.29,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You put so much thought into this choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:20.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It started getting fun, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:26.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You looked {\i1}this{\i0} serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:29.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:36.46,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This one...? Or maybe this one...? \NMutter mutter mutter mutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:36.46,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:41.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Next, I'll pick something out for you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:51.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Could you look a little less hostile?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ladies first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.61,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Fank yoo so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What kind of voice is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.85,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's my voice for the kitties!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:08.71,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Sign,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HC6D7DF&\move(400.778,357.666,398.111,139.888,26,514)}{\blur0.4\b0\fs16}Cat Cafe
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.60,0:17:08.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah, but they're not actually here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come here, sweetie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:21.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:23.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What? You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:25.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What the—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Must be nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:36.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,They love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't have enough hands to pet them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:41.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna play with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.35,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I'm a one-cat girl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:55.89,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:17:59.86,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:03.88,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:08.23,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Meow, meow meow meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:08.89,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing, Cool-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you friends already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.85,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This one responds to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:20.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah, but mine climb all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:23.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,They've turned you \Ninto a cat tower, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:26.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You mean I'm just a toy to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:34.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, now I'm starting to feel jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you mind if our party joins you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But we were having a quiet, intimate moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:18:59.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:02.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sharing is caring!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Want me to walk you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:10.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just to the bus station is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But we won't see each other \Nagain until next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.89,0:19:18.03,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't want to ask for too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:28.85,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:42.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Just let me recharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:59.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now I should be fine until I see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:03.95,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me \Nfor even a single day, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:09.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right. When I get home, I'm gonna \Nplaster your pics all over my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:16.52,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,You're leaving already? Walk me home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:19.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay, {\i1}now{\i0} you're being spoiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:30.04,sign_21435_181_Could_we_meet_up,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\pos(297.556,32)\frz9.182}Headed your way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:30.04,sign_21435_181_Could_we_meet_up,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\frz7.865\pos(344.666,76.445)}Wait for me by the front gate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:30.04,sign_21435_181_Could_we_meet_up,Text signs,0,0,0,,{\frz8.991\pos(443.334,150.222)}Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:33.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:40.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:43.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Look... I don't know \Nhow to tell you this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:50.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But a classmate of mine \Nasked me out at college today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:57.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I turned her down, of course, \Nbut then she cried a ton...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:21:01.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And now I'm feeling down too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:09.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:15.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you don't know, then I guess \Nit's only natural that I wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:19.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What a relief! Now I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:26.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, the outfit \Nyou chose for me was a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.13,0:21:29.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Everyone said I look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's never happened before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:42.38,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Is Senpai popular at college?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:17.56,main,Rin/Eiji,0,0,0,,Meow meow meow meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:18.46,sign_33852_355_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.45,0:23:21.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:27.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I thought for sure when you became \Nan actress you'd land some hot actor...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:31.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And after you moved to Hollywood? \NDon't get me started!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:34.21,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I've seriously moved up in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.67,0:23:37.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I never forgot about you, even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.18,0:23:42.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then again, as an art director of renown,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:47.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,we have worked together \Nin world-class projects around the globe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.25,0:23:49.98,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,This is a lot of new \Nbackground information...
